        <title type="html"><![CDATA[docs: Add reference for CSS value serialization, especially colors]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41322</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41322"/>
        <updated>2025-09-29T04:06:11.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12285999?u=183d27a6aca0718cb83ecec3c8e7745502384f48&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h1 dir="auto">Add reference for CSS value serialization, especially colors</h1>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #32734.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2193690629" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32734" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/32734/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32734">#32734</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Adds a new guide explaining CSS value serialization through JavaScript APIs, with a focus on how color values (hsl(), hwb(), etc.) are serialized to rgb()/rgba() format when accessed via getComputedStyle() or getPropertyValue().</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">This documentation helps developers understand why and how CSS values, especially colors, might return in different formats than they were written. This addresses a common source of confusion when working with CSS values through JavaScript APIs.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">References:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom/#serialize-a-css-value" rel="nofollow">CSSOM Specification - Serializing CSS Values</a></li>
<li><a href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-4/#serialization" rel="nofollow">CSS Color Module Level 4 - Serialization</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #32734.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2193690629" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32734" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/32734/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32734">#32734</a> - Creates documentation for CSS value serialization, especially for colors</p>]]></content>
